  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The National parliament has successfully fulfilled its consultation mandates &#x2013; legislative, oversight representational functions &#x2013; which led the political economic and social development in Timor-Leste. In order to address the challenges faced by the National Parliament, the project will focus on the National parliament&#x2019;s further institutional development particularly in training and capacity building, technical expertise, regulator impact analysis, digital transformation, citizen engagement, co</narrative>
  </description>
